ers are comma-separated. Supported numeric operators include greaterthan, lessthan, is, isnot, between, and notbetween. The between and notbetween operators use the format min-max."},"timeFilter":{"type":"string","description":"Time-based filter expression used to filter results by time field. Format: field|operator|value.\n\nAllowed fields (same as `timeField` parameter):\n- eventEsTimestamp : Last Seen\n- first_session_unix_timestamp : First Seen\n\nSupported operators:\n- exactly   → integer value (0 = Today, 1 = Yesterday)\n- lessthan  → integer value (e.g. 6 = last 7 days)\n- between   → date range in format dd/MM/yyyy-dd/MM/yyyy\n\nLocale settings are taken into account while interpreting dates and returning results."},"fieldFilter":{"type":"string","description":"Field-based filter used to include leads based on field presence.\n\nFormat:\noperator|field1;field2\n\nAllowed operator:\n- hasanyvalue\n\nAllowed fields:\n- firstName\n- lastName\n- email\n\nMultiple fields can be provided using semicolons."},"exitLinkFilter":{"type":"string","description":"Exit link filter used to include or exclude leads based on exit link values.\n\nFormat:\nfield|operator|value\n\nSupported operators:\n- contains\n- is\n- isnot\n- doesnotcontain\n\nMultiple values can be provided using semicolons.","example":"exitLinkFilter|contains|leads"},"leadscoreFilter":{"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"integer","description":"Filters leads based on given minimum leadscore.","format":"int32"},"displayFilter":{"type":"string","description":"Display filter used to control which types of leads are returned.\n\nSupported values:\n- company\n- person\n- unidentified\n\nSelecting 'unidentified' returns leads that could not be identified as a company or a person.\n\nMultiple values can be provided using semicolons."},"fromFilter":{"type":"string","description":"Filters leads based on specified from user"},"owner":{"type":"string","description":"Filters leads based specified owner(userId)"},"hidden":{"type":"string","description":"Filters leads based on presetInclusionList"},"search":{"type":"string","description":"Keyword search."},"emailView":{"type":"string","description":"Email view type.<br/>Possible values : NONE, LEAD, ACCOUNT<br/>","example":"LEAD","default":"NONE","enum":["NONE","LEAD","ACCOUNT"]},"notificationType":{"type":"string","description":"Set notification frequency.<br/><br/><b>Possible values:</b><br/><b>NONE</b> : Do not send any notification.<br/><b>DAILY</b> : Send notification daily.<br/><b>WEEKLY</b> : Send notification weekly.","example":"DAILY","enum":["NONE","DAILY","WEEKLY"]},"notificationMailIds":{"type":"string","description":"List of comma separated email addresses for notification.","example":"user1@example.com,user2@example.com"},"mailTemplate":{"type":"string","description":"Set headlines for the notification email.","example":"Weekly Lead Summary"},"format":{"type":"string","description":"Format for the segment notification.<br/>Possible values : html, csv","example":"html"},"dayOfWeek":{"type":"integer","description":"Day of week on which weekly notification will be sent. Possible values include numbers from 1 to 7 (where 1 refers to Monday).","format":"int32","example":1},"additionalCsvFields":{"type":"string","description":"List of comma separated fields to be included in CSV.","example":"email,companyName,jobTitle"},"sortBy":{"type":"string","description":"Field to sort result.<br/>Possible values :<br/><b>_score</b> : records sorted by leadscore.<br/><b>lastEvent</b> : records sorted by activity time.<br/>Default : _score","example":"_score"},"sortOrder":{"type":"string","description":"Sort order.<br/>Possible values : asc, desc<br/>Default : desc","example":"desc"},"viewType":{"type":"string","description":"View type.<br/>Possible values : B2B, B2C<br/>Default : B2B","example":"B2B"},"list":{"type":"string","description":"Filters list file saved using List Settings Page."},"timeField":{"type":"string"},"csvSetName":{